        "answer": {
          "short": "$2:1$",
          "worked": "$\\$1=100\\text{ cents}$. The HCF of 100 and 50 is 50.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Ali}:\\text{Cathy}&=100:50\\\\&=(100\\div50):(50\\div50)\\\\&=2:1\\end{align*}$$",
